    // Validates (server-side, authoritative) that TotalBudget == AllocatedAmount + RemainingAmount
    // and marks the StateBudgetSummary "Submitted". Called from SubmitForValidationAsync, right
    // after the detail allocation is saved and before it's marked Submitted - a mismatch here
